### Xác thực OTP (web - cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: pendingToken=your-pending-token-here

{
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Xác thực OTP (mobile - header X-Pending-Token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
X-Pending-Token: your-pending-token-here

{
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Xác thực OTP sai
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: pendingToken=your-pending-token-here

{
  "otp": "000000"
}
